@startuml F4.1d-aprovacao-lote
title F4.1d — Aprovação em lote (presença validada)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "CAAFController" as Ctrl
participant "BatchDecideFormativesUC" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: Confirmar lote
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /comissoes/caaf/lote
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: UPDATE N itens\n+ event_log cada\n+ outbox lote
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> Ctrl: ok
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Prof: banner certificados

@enduml
